{"id":"modeste","lemma":"modeste","pos":"adj","rank":3664,"glosses":["modest, humble","modest, low"],"ipa":"/mɔ.dɛst/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/Fr-modeste.ogg/Fr-modeste.ogg.mp3","forms":{"plural":"modestes"},"examples":[{"text":"Vous êtes trop modeste.","en":"You're too humble.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"too"},null]},{"text":"Oh, ne soyez pas si modestes !","en":"Oh, don't be so modest.","words":[{"g":"oh"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"if, whether"},null]},{"text":"Je suis fort modeste.","en":"I'm very modest.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"strongly"},null]},{"text":"Je viens d'un milieu modeste.","en":"I come from a humble background.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"middle"},null]},{"text":"C'est un modeste prix à payer.","en":"It's a small price to pay.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"prize"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to pay"}]}]}